[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10443.51, "timestamp": "02:54:03", "text": "等待。就像你很喜欢……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10445.83, "timestamp": "02:54:05", "text": "如果我需要出去透透气，我会告诉你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10449.83, "timestamp": "02:54:09", "text": "我能看到，我能感受到群山。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10453.349, "timestamp": "02:54:13", "text": "俯瞰天空，与大自然融为一体"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10456.83, "timestamp": "02:54:16", "text": "现在还有一些其他的东西。是的。这就是我的原因"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10460.469, "timestamp": "02:54:20", "text": "兴奋的。希望一切顺利。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10462.55, "timestamp": "02:54:22", "text": "是啊，我也希望如此。那种外观"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10466.67, "timestamp": "02:54:26", "text": "非常期待。我，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10469.15, "timestamp": "02:54:29", "text": "也。不能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10472.55, "timestamp": "02:54:32", "text": "等待。现在是12点。不，你也应该去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10475.349, "timestamp": "02:54:35", "text": "睡觉。你什么时候睡觉？实际上，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10483.83, "timestamp": "02:54:43", "text": "是的，谢谢你今天的一切。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10486.23, "timestamp": "02:54:46", "text": "真有趣"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10488.63, "timestamp": "02:54:48", "text": "是的，谢谢你邀请我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10490.95, "timestamp": "02:54:50", "text": "挺开心的，一个小时就这么过去了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10494.469, "timestamp": "02:54:54", "text": "即使意识到这一点，是的，所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10496.95, "timestamp": "02:54:56", "text": "是的，我们聊了很多，那真是……"}]